{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27912","headline":"和刘补阙秋园寓兴之什十首 二 · 朱庆余","name":"和刘补阙秋园寓兴之什十首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"谁言高静意，不异在衡茅。\n竹冷人离洞，天晴鹤出巢。\n深篱藏白菌，荒蔓露青匏。\n几见中宵月，清光坠树梢。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"朱庆余","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_27912.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27912","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}